    {"entry_index":0,"uid":"zhcn:fed1870ac13ab49b3f8829a5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呀——玩得真开心耶，训练员。","source_fingerprint":"fead768f5325c96350c1a419dcece927df1e759572114bcb1161c6b58dffe9d8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","2035"],"target_text":"A—— chơi vui thật đấy, Trainer.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":1,"uid":"zhcn:3d0c3c7dbefbd8e8648ef3b3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"ほいほーい。","source_fingerprint":"6b4e70ab74dbbfd458210d0723cdd7fe7676c9f7814b83f396ce91504b5bb7c9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","23015"],"target_text":"Rồi rồi～.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":2,"uid":"zhcn:167eadb9004bb1aeeb1bbbde","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"做得好，做得好——♪","source_fingerprint":"4129c2ff8c874d2ca42241807a84bebdff0831db79f5fccc2c4666ca6b84cda8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","30000"],"target_text":"Giỏi lắm, giỏi lắm——♪","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":3,"uid":"zhcn:021d981f99b10e118d0d6e02","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"总之就当作肯做就能做到咯～","source_fingerprint":"de2541da30bdeb218550fa26fe52d909c34ed929bb816d8ae9d92e58c4883541","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","30001"],"target_text":"Cứ coi như chịu làm thì sẽ làm được thôi～","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":4,"uid":"zhcn:1a4303ed47375291a6dd074d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"应该算是还可以吧——？","source_fingerprint":"fe1697186fce25e8b9f1a7a7e15d58904a581fac34f28144bc7b9874799d7552","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","30002"],"target_text":"Chắc cũng tạm ổn nhỉ——?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":5,"uid":"zhcn:494f5f75cba28b17744f4354","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哎呀——没能成功啊——啊哈哈——","source_fingerprint":"6548aec511ac6cd36202d4731a55096a7a422c1b8d251e99f268c36718bca7ed","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","30003"],"target_text":"Ôi chà—— không thành công mất rồi—— a ha ha——","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":6,"uid":"zhcn:423ee4cbf6efb3a6e7a61907","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"多么令人满意的结果啊……哦哆！？唔～呵呵。","source_fingerprint":"c5e41752b38e9f5bb9d331405a928d9bee5cd0acd3946a88e99a706ff21da1cc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","30004"],"target_text":"Kết quả mãn nguyện thật đấy…… Ối!? Ư～ hư hư.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":7,"uid":"zhcn:8e7bbf40075438cf43594a04","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"欢呼声好像……比预期的还要大？","source_fingerprint":"2bb803de3dc77b1e7465239ae4d64dabd447604944db615febefa205c857e344","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","30005"],"target_text":"Tiếng reo hò hình như…… còn lớn hơn mình tưởng?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":8,"uid":"zhcn:6dce692e296c0204873b5ef3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"将这场胜利献给你。\r\n……不是骗你的哦？","source_fingerprint":"0f92bbe4bbf9d7cf9166c95e9c9a1947b9578540c9bc402c9e0e475e27498027","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","30006"],"target_text":"Chiến thắng này dành tặng cho cậu.\r\n……Tôi không nói đùa đâu nhé?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":9,"uid":"zhcn:e72b32844819b05eda9b28a2","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"比预料之中还要响亮的欢呼声……吗？","source_fingerprint":"a2b77b7140a63e4ab759cab7ea972525fb4b38ef0d8d4ca6f0ddd68822bf86c1","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","30007"],"target_text":"Tiếng reo hò còn vang hơn dự tính…… sao?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":10,"uid":"zhcn:c36550c8ac919438c36c9014","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"那我就上场咯——","source_fingerprint":"1bb0e49dd6813c30355fecd6d3b3398c2d77cf59aedcd70d9545136f9b749da0","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","31000"],"target_text":"Vậy tôi ra sân đây——","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":11,"uid":"zhcn:b980b5dfb04a7a88847909c6","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……来了！就是现在——！","source_fingerprint":"373f6d6af1d9ff5dca8520f20a268b049ba3045550d082ea34b6408feba9b930","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","40000"],"target_text":"……Đến rồi! Chính là lúc này——!","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":12,"uid":"zhcn:ab398f3f1d9d746f618232ec","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"富士同学吗……她每次来美浦宿舍的时候，\r\n我们都会猜谁又会被她迷住。亚马逊同学嘛……\r\n倒是感觉她一直在生气来着。","source_fingerprint":"6bfc3d53598684d94749088b4569701a38054921a14e1a4fc7c033d8913dcd5b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","400001"],"target_text":"Fuji à…… mỗi lần cô ấy ghé ký túc xá Miho,\r\nbọn tôi lại đoán xem lần này ai sẽ bị cô ấy mê hoặc. Còn Amazon thì……\r\ncứ có cảm giác lúc nào cô ấy cũng đang nổi giận.","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":13,"uid":"zhcn:5c0c5cd7014ede6a911b9bd9","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呼啊～……那个啊。所谓的幸福，\r\n说不定指的就是睡到午后吧。\r\n好啦，今天的饭会是什么呢～？","source_fingerprint":"9d0b76168ddce71a34fc282a012f9f3b1c72ec9e2152d7200551e3d8bddd80eb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","400002"],"target_text":"Hà～…… này nhé. Cái gọi là hạnh phúc,\r\nbiết đâu chính là được ngủ đến tận chiều.\r\nNào, hôm nay ăn gì đây ta～?","reviewed":true},
    {"entry_index":14,"uid":"zhcn:1f1cd936b7b2d35feb999d49","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"知ってるよ、キングが諦め悪いって\r\nことくらい。対策、さんざん\r\n苦労させられたんだからさ～。","source_fingerprint":"a3164db88fb493d7e3f8b4891d423d2efaf8451fdb9fe2043d48375ebb090cd3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","400003"],"target_text":"Tớ biết chứ, King chẳng chịu bỏ cuộc đâu.\r\nChỉ riêng việc nghĩ cách đối phó\r\nđã làm tớ khổ sở bao lần rồi mà～.","reviewed":true}
  ]
}